  ('e2000000-0000-4000-a000-0000000007e7', 'ENEM-2020-004-ING', 2, 467, 'enem', 3, 2, 2020, 'multiple_choice', 'Leitura em língua inglesa', '**A Minor Bird**

I have wished a bird would fly away,  
And not sing by my house all day;

