No texto, a expressão “un mañana sin sol” é usada para concluir uma critica ao(à)', 'Gabarito oficial do INEP: alternativa A.', null, 'ENEM 2022 · 1º dia · Questão 4 (Espanhol) · Prova oficial aplicada pelo INEP.', 'published', '2026-11-28T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('e2000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000953', 'ENEM-2022-004-ING', 2, 467, 'enem', 3, 2, 2022, 'multiple_choice', 'Leitura em língua inglesa', '**A Teen’s View of Social Media**

Instagram is by far my favorite. It is made up of all photos and videos, which is perfect for visual people like me. There is the home page that showcases the posts from people you follow, an explore tab which offers posts from accounts all over the world, and your own page, with a notification tab to show who likes and comments on your posts.

It has some downsides though.  It is known to make many people feel insecure or down about themselves because the platform showcases the highlights of everyone’s lives, while rarely showing the negatives. This can make one feel like their life is not going as well as others, contributing to the growing rates of anxiety or depression in many teens today. There is an underlying desire for acceptance through the number of likes or followers one has.

**Disponível em: https://cyberbullying.org/. Acesso em: 29 out. 2021.**

O termo “downsides” introduz a ideia de que o Instagram é responsável por', 'Gabarito oficial do INEP: alternativa D.', null, 'ENEM 2022 · 1º dia · Questão 4 (Inglês) · Prova oficial aplicada pelo INEP.', 'published', '2026-11-28T00:00:00.000Z'),
